#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/fullconenat-sonic.js:44
#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/fullconenat-sonic.js:51
msgid "Fullcone NAT"
msgstr "全锥型NAT"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/root/usr/share/rpcd/acl.d/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic.json:3
msgid "Grant access to fullcone firewall settings"
msgstr "授予访问全锥型防火墙设置的权限"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/fullconenat-sonic.js:53
msgid ""
"Uses all supported protocols. Enabling Fullcone NAT automatically enables "
"IPv4 and IPv6 masquerading. Disabling either masquerading option also "
"disables Fullcone NAT for this zone. Disabling Fullcone NAT leaves "
"masquerading unchanged. Usually enable this only on the WAN zone."
msgstr ""
"使用所有受支持的协议。启用全锥型NAT时自动开启 IPv4 和 IPv6 地址伪装。关闭任一"
"地址伪装选项时，也会关闭对应区域的全锥型NAT。关闭全锥型NAT不会更改地址伪装设"
"置。通常仅需在 WAN 区域开启。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/fullconenat-sonic.js:54
msgid ""
"Uses all supported protocols. Enabling Fullcone NAT automatically enables "
"IPv4 masquerading. Disabling masquerading also disables Fullcone NAT for "
"this zone. Disabling Fullcone NAT leaves masquerading unchanged. Usually "
"enable this only on the WAN zone."
msgstr ""
"使用所有受支持的协议。启用全锥型NAT时自动开启 IPv4 地址伪装。关闭地址伪装时，"
"也会关闭对应区域的全锥型NAT。关闭全锥型NAT不会更改地址伪装设置。通常仅需在 "
"WAN 区域开启。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:204
msgid "%s: no current address, NAT1 is not applied"
msgstr "%s：当前没有可用地址，NAT1 不会生效"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:208
msgid "%s: no static lease, the address may change"
msgstr "%s：没有静态租约，地址可能会变化"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:165
msgid "Additional IP addresses"
msgstr "附加 IP 地址"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:117
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "设备"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:144
msgid "Devices (by MAC)"
msgstr "设备（按 MAC）"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:121
msgid "Devices chosen by MAC address are resolved to their current IP address "
"every time this page is saved, because the firewall works with "
"addresses. Devices without a static lease may change their address at "
"any time, so configuring a static lease for them is recommended."
msgstr "由于防火墙按地址工作，按 MAC 选择的设备会在每次保存本页时解析为其当前 IP "
"地址。未配置静态租约的设备地址可能随时变化，建议为其配置静态租约。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:136
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:105
msgid "Fullcone NAT - Device Access Control"
msgstr "全锥形 NAT - 设备访问控制"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:108
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "常规设置"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/root/usr/share/rpcd/acl.d/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic-acl.json:3
msgid "Grant access to the fullcone NAT device access control settings"
msgstr "授予访问全锥形 NAT 设备访问控制设置的权限"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:168
msgid "IP address or subnet, e.g. 192.168.1.50 or 192.168.1.0/24"
msgstr "IP 地址或子网，例如 192.168.1.50 或 192.168.1.0/24"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:106
msgid "Limits fullcone NAT (NAT1) to the devices listed below. Devices that are "
"not listed keep ordinary masquerading and are not reachable from the "
"internet through this mapping. The master switch and the per-zone switch "
"are configured under Firewall - Zone Settings; this page only takes "
"effect for zones that have fullcone NAT enabled there."
msgstr "把全锥形 NAT（NAT1）限制为下方列出的设备使用。未列出的设备仍使用普通地址伪装，不会被该映射暴露到公网。总开关与各区域开关位于\"防火墙 "
"- 区域设置\"，本页仅对在那里已启用全锥形 NAT 的区域生效。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:213
msgid "No device address configured - fullcone NAT is disabled for every device "
"of this zone."
msgstr "未配置任何设备地址——该区域内所有设备的全锥形 NAT 均被禁用。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:112
msgid "Only allow NAT1 for the listed devices"
msgstr "仅对列表中的设备启用 NAT1"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:147
msgid "Pick a device or enter its MAC address"
msgstr "选择设备或直接输入其 MAC 地址"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:221
msgid "Re-resolve the MAC addresses above to their current IP addresses. Saving "
"this page does this automatically."
msgstr "将上述 MAC 地址重新解析为当前 IP 地址。保存本页时会自动执行该操作。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:219
msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "刷新"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:140
msgid "Remarks"
msgstr "备注"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:218
msgid "Resolve MAC addresses"
msgstr "解析 MAC 地址"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:239
msgid "Resolved %d address(es). Save the configuration to apply them."
msgstr "已解析出 %d 个地址。保存配置后生效。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:189
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:115
msgid "Until this is enabled, every device of a zone with fullcone NAT enabled "
"receives NAT1 mappings. Once enabled, only the devices listed below do; "
"an empty list therefore disables fullcone NAT mappings entirely."
msgstr "未启用时，已开启全锥形 NAT 的区域内的所有设备都会获得 NAT1 映射；启用后则仅列表中的设备获得，因此列表为空时完全不创建 NAT1 "
"映射。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:169
msgid "Use these entries for devices with a fixed address; they are applied as "
"given and are not resolved."
msgstr "固定地址的设备可直接使用此列表；条目按原样应用，不做解析。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/firewall/fullconenat-acl.js:142
msgid "e.g. living room PC"
msgstr "例如：客厅的电脑"

